@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch17ch18-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch17ch18-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 17 and 18"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.7.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch17ch18-lineage/1.7.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch17ch18_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.7.0 (2026-11-11): Change request, Scope stage only. Gap found while the ZIP story was replaced: no step of this lineage checks a chapter's stories against the chapters already presented (the deck standard check tests each story slide alone). Owner ruling the same day: chapters already presented are not updated until the whole book is finished, the midterm chapters stay as they are, and time for correcting them is reserved only after the book; chapters not yet presented are brought into the check. This lineage therefore gains one area and one deliverable for chapters 17 and 18, and one exclusion that records the deferral. Goal, objective and backlog follow in separate versions."""@en .

ex:Scope7 backlog:coversArea ex:Area7_StoryUniqueness ;
    backlog:hasScopeExclusion ex:Excl7_CoveredChapterCorrections ;
    backlog:hasScopeDeliverable ex:Del7_StoryUniquenessRecord ;
    rdfs:comment "Changed 2026-11-11 on the owner's ruling: story-uniqueness check added for the chapters not yet presented (17 and 18); corrections to already-presented chapters recorded as deferred until the whole book is finished."@en .

ex:Area7_StoryUniqueness a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Chapter 17-18 stories checked against the chapters already presented"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage7 .

ex:Del7_StoryUniquenessRecord a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ;
    rdfs:label "Record of every chapter 17-18 story against the presented chapters, each repeat replaced or confirmed by the owner"@en ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage7 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area7_StoryUniqueness .

ex:Excl7_CoveredChapterCorrections a backlog:ScopeExclusion ;
    rdfs:label "Corrections to chapters already presented (1-16), including the midterm chapters"@en ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage7 ;
    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "Owner ruling 2026-11-11: presented chapters are not updated until the whole book is finished; the midterm chapters stay as they are. Time to correct them is reserved only after the book. Repeats found in them (JSON ch10, UTF-8 ch8/ch10, PEP 572 ch2/ch3) stay recorded and are not changed here." .
